  "prefLabel": "Env-A 809.03 Alternate Methods for Federal Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 809.03 Alternate Methods for Federal Standards. An owner or operator seeking approval of modifications to test methods or of alternate test methods for compliance with federal standards, such as those specified in 40 CFR 60, 61, 63, and 75, shall submit the request to EPA for approval.\n\nSource. #9802, eff 10-31-10 (from Env-A 809.02); ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a800.html"
